    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chapter 4 Launching end of October 2025</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose has just moved to a small town ready to start a new life. Luckily, she quickly found a job as a receptionist at the Helios Hotel, the fancy new hotel in town. Her first day proves working at the Helios Hotel isn't quite what she was expecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rose and perform the functions of the hotel receptionist while uncovering strange occurrences that begin to unfold more and more each night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045330/extras/Pumpkin_Guy_Small.PNG?t=1753328085\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short indie horror game broken down into chapters. There will be four chapters with the full game taking around 1 hour to complete. Each chapter may take an average of 15 minutes to complete depending on how much exploration is done. The game is launching with the first two chapters available with the next two chapters coming as free updates to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1: First Day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 2: The Son</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 3: Halloween Morning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 4: ETA end of October 2025</p>",
